'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Map of Tarkov|location]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''. It is the fifth map that was added to the game.

==Description==
The South Interchange is a key transport location for the city. This strategic area connects the port and harbor with the industrial outskirts of Tarkov. Located in the center of the interchange is a huge ULTRA shopping mall which was used as the main base of operation for the EMERCOM evacuation.

==Features==
* Stationary weapons in the form of [[NSV Utyos 12.7x108 heavy machine gun]]s.
* Be aware of [[Map of Tarkov#Border Snipers|Border Snipers]] and [[Map of Tarkov#Minefields|Minefields]]!
* A fully linked illumination grid, able to be switched on at the power station.
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:PowerStationMap.png|Power station marked on map
File:InterchangePowerStation.png|The power station
File:Power switch.png|The power switch inside the station
File:PowerStationSwitchOn.png|A green light shows when the switch is turned on
</gallery></li>
* Alarms around some stores and a triggerable alarm at the [[Kiba Arms inner grate door key|KIBA Arms store]]. The alarms can be switched off at designated terminals.
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:Interchange alarm map.png|Alarm switches marked on map
File:Inter alarm terminal 2.png|Alarm switch in the security room on the first floor: Turns off all alarms in the mall
File:Inter alarm terminal.png|Alarm switch at the information desk on the second floor: Turns off all alarms in the mall except for the [[Kiba Arms inner grate door key|KIBA Arms store]]
</gallery></li>

